      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's the thing, they *aren't* just seeing me. They see the scholarship, the grades, the future. If I can't be that person, then what am I actually providing to them? just a burden. i feel like i'm just dragging them down further every day i exist as this version of me. it's like... once that image is broken, it's gone forever. there's no going back to being the \"golden child.\" everything is just ruined now.",
